COM expand: the automatic specifications this network expands.
CONTINGENCY 'EXPLICIT'
OPEN LINE FROM BUS    101 TO BUS    102 CIRCUIT 1
END
SINGLE BRANCH IN SUBSYSTEM 'A1' 3WLOWVOLTAGE
SINGLE UNIT IN SUBSYSTEM 'A1'
SINGLE TIE FROM SUBSYSTEM 'A1'
DOUBLE BRANCH IN SUBSYSTEM 'A1'
SINGLE BRANCH IN SUBSYSTEM 'NOSUCH'
SKIP
101 TO 102 CIRCUIT 2
END
END
